  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Southern Border immortals who chased Fang Yuan are trapped inside. Some take it for an immortal battlefield. Lu Wei Yin identifies it as a super immortal formation. Xia Cha adds that it is a time path formation. Fang Yuan chose a formation because his strongest immortal battlefields, purple star broken life and yama battlefield, are rank seven and cannot trap rank eight Xia Cha and Lu Wei Yin. Immortal battlefield Gu usually stay on the Gu Immortal and isolate a fighting environment. Immortal formation Gu remain in the outside world. Most immortal formations are defensive internally and offensive externally. This time path formation isolates the formation space so he can kill enemies inside.",
      "chapters": [
        1601
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_southern_border",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_lu_wei_yin",
        "char_xia_cha",
