      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It is the combination of three formations. Shadow Sect used dense time path natural dao marks to conceal a tributary of the River of Time. Flood discharge formation can connect to that tributary. Immemorial year beast fishing formation, built with rank eight Immortal Gu Years Flow Like Water, summons year beasts from the River of Time. Fang Yuan’s formation path and time path grandmaster attainment, Hei Fan’s true inheritance, Spectral Soul’s true inheritance, and the light of wisdom let him deduce and create this huge formation. Bai Ning Bing, Hei Lou Lan, Lady White Rabbit, Fairy Miao Yin, and Ying Wu Xie each take a formation core. Active time path methods accelerate enemy killer moves to their time limit so they fade. Destroying a formation core opens another spiral entrance and more year beasts rush in, including immemorial year beasts.",
      "chapters": [
        1601
      ],
